WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.532
Welcome to your dashboard. Let's take a quick look around.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.069
This is the Overview. It's home base, and the sidebar on the left takes you everywhere else.

00:00:10.419 --> 00:00:15.323
Looking for something? Search finds projects, parts, and documents from anywhere.

00:00:15.673 --> 00:00:19.471
Next to it, two badges: your alerts, and your unread emails.

00:00:19.821 --> 00:00:25.862
Needs attention is your to-do list. The most urgent things across every department, each with a shortcut.

00:00:26.212 --> 00:00:29.035
Pick a project here, and the whole page follows it.

00:00:30.862 --> 00:00:35.880
This bar shows where the project stands, from engineering all the way to invoiced.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:41.827
Four tiles give you the headlines: order value, delivery date, production, and invoicing.

00:00:42.177 --> 00:00:46.893
Scroll down for the charts: your pipeline, the shop floor, and the money coming in.

00:00:47.827 --> 00:00:52.743
Departments shows the same project in every team. Click a card to jump right in.

00:00:54.243 --> 00:00:57.553
And the dock at the bottom brings you home again, any time.

00:00:58.753 --> 00:01:03.518
Last one. Right at the bottom, recent activity logs every change, in order.

00:01:04.418 --> 00:01:08.160
That's the tour. And you can rearrange all of it in Configuration.

